WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.820
I think he wants you

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:23.480
Jake's very special

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:26.200
He's always liked doing things his own way

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.980
Where are you guys applying?
Oh boy

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:33.180
Even if we could afford it, 
is a private school even what I want for Jake?

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.080
I know we've always said 
we're not those parents, but...

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.800
Well, we can't afford to be.
No, but maybe...

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.360
The numbers are ridiculous, 
but what you have to remember...

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:41.840
Everybody wants diversity

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.820
Why not talk a little about his gender expansive play?

00:00:44.820 --> 00:00:47.920
You want him to be somewhere he can thrive, right?

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.800
You really don't think it's weird?

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.240
I mean, he does like to play dress-up.
That's not news

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:58.260
Yeah, he likes fairy tales, but maybe
 that's not the most critical thing worth mentioning.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:01.040
He asked why boys can't wear skirts

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:05.000
I don't want to send him off to kindergarten labeled. 
He's only four

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:07.640
What if he starts thinking 
there's something wrong with him?

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.460
Where is my favorite grandson?

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.460
I haven't heard from you
in over a week

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:16.660
Gotta push, push, push!
Gotta let go, right?

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:20.500
In a few weeks, we'll visit some new schools, 
and you should just be yourself

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:21.780
That's all that matters, okay?

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:24.100
There's no big deal at all.
Yeah

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.780
I'd like to show you something

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.380
There were one or two incidents in class

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.100
I hate you!

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:38.820
Kindergarten, it's so hard for a child, you know, who...

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:40.460
Who what?

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:44.360
You two have some choices to make here

00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:45.840
Maybe we should bring him to see someone

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:50.000
Maybe the problem is 
that we started pushing him into this role

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:56.100
You're the one buying him every princess DVD 
you can get your hands on...

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.700
and then freaking out when people start to notice

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:01.180
Is it any wonder he's confused?

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.300
You try so hard to protect them, but...

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:13.780
It's never gonna be easy to really see people

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:16.700
Especially the ones we love

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:23.160
One, two, three, whee!

